          <attvalue for="29" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="0.75" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Sustained reductions in chokepoint security prompt regional and extra‑regional navies and air forces to increase patrols, escorts, interdictions, and targeted strikes to protect transits, raising the intensity of kinetic engagements." />
