          <attvalue for="35" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="An increase in chokepoint insecurity (more attacks or interdictions) provokes naval escorts, interdiction operations and political-military responses from states dependent on the routes, which raises incentives and pressure to widen or intensify military action in the conflict theatre." />
