          <attvalue for="33" value="+" />
          <attvalue for="29" value="3" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="0.7" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Visible, high‑intensity drone employment in Ukraine accelerates proliferation of tactics, ready designs and commercial procurement channels that Iran and Iran-linked proxies adopt to harass or strike shipping and offshore infrastructure, raising incidents at sea." />
