          <attvalue for="35" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="A sharp escalation in Ukraine draws diplomatic attention and enforcement resources toward Russia, causing Western agencies and partner governments to deprioritize operational enforcement actions against Iran and affiliated networks, reducing sanctions intensity." />
