          <attvalue for="35" value="0.8" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Visible intensification or widening of the conflict raises perceived strategic risk among US policymakers, prompting faster tightening of export controls, vetting of foreign partnerships, and other security-driven constraints on AI and data flows vis-à-vis China." />
