          <attvalue for="35" value="0.55" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Aggressive central‑bank market interventions that stabilize financial markets and preserve bank balance sheets give sanctioning governments and compliance units more operational capacity and political room to sustain or tighten sanctions enforcement in the short term." />
