          <attvalue for="29" value="3" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="0.7" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Rising national-security pressure in the US–China tech rivalry prompts increased naval deployments, patrols and contested maneuvers around major maritime chokepoints (e.g., South China Sea approaches), raising the frequency of close encounters and transits disruptions and thereby reducing operational openness and security." />
