          <attvalue for="35" value="0.65" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Rising national-security pressure from the U.S.–China tech rivalry redirects political attention and budgetary priorities toward Indo‑Pacific capabilities, causing legislators and the executive to delay or reduce the rate of new Ukraine military aid appropriations." />
